Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:01.27,S,,0,0,0,,{\pos(500,1550)\fs58}FOR FIVE YEARS, THIS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.27,0:00:02.63,S,,0,0,0,,{\pos(500,1550)\fs58}MAN WAS\NPRESUMED {\c&H0073CCF0&}DEAD.{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
