Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.45,0:00:25.78,S,,0,0,0,,{\pos(500,1550)\fs58}IN DECEMBER\NTWO THOUSAND
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.78,0:00:27.25,S,,0,0,0,,{\pos(500,1550)\fs58}SEVEN, HE RETURNED.
